1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,880
Ready? 애, 에!
Ready? ae, e! (two new letters)

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,230
모양만 달라!
moyangman dalla! (only the shape is different!)

3
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:04,130
애, 에!
ae, e!

4
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,910
모양만 달라!
moyangman dalla! (only the shape is different!)

5
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:10,120
둘 다 에!
dul da e! (both say "e"!)

6
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,500
아 애! 어 에!
a ae! eo e! (add one stick — the sound becomes "e")

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,930
가 개! 거 게!
ga gae! geo ge!

8
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:17,330
나 내! 너 네!
na nae! neo ne!

9
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,840
사 새! 서 세!
sa sae! seo se!

10
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:21,510
모양만 달라,
moyangman dalla, (only the shape is different,)

11
00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:23,020
둘 다 에!
dul da e! (both say "e"!)

12
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:26,450
이건 뭐?
igeon mwo? (what is this? read it before the song does!)

13
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:27,830
개!
gae! (dog)

14
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:31,250
이건 뭐?
igeon mwo? (read it first!)

15
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:34,100
게!
ge! (crab) — the same sound as 개!

16
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,700
개 게 내 네 새 세 애 에!
gae ge nae ne sae se ae e! (dog, crab, my, yes, bird, three — all "e")

17
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,920
모양만 달라, 둘 다 에!
moyangman dalla, dul da e! (only the shape is different — both say "e"!)

18
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,500
개 게 내 네 새 세 애 에!
gae ge nae ne sae se ae e! (dog, crab, my, yes, bird, three — all "e")

19
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,720
모양만 달라, 둘 다 에!
moyangman dalla, dul da e! (only the shape is different — both say "e"!)

20
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,110
안! 녕! 하! 세! 요!
an! nyeong! ha! se! yo!

21
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:48,520
안녕하세요, 안녕하세요!
annyeonghaseyo! (hello — polite)

22
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:50,920
노! 래! 해! 요!
no! rae! hae! yo!

23
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,820
노래해요?
noraehaeyo? (shall we sing?)

24
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,320
네! 네! 네! 네!
ne! ne! ne! ne! (yes! — 네 says "e" too)

25
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,910
개 게 내 네 새 세 애 에!
gae ge nae ne sae se ae e! (dog, crab, my, yes, bird, three — all "e")

26
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:58,110
모양만 달라, 둘 다 에!
moyangman dalla, dul da e! (only the shape is different — both say "e"!)

27
00:00:58,110 --> 00:01:00,710
개 게 내 네 새 세 애 에!
gae ge nae ne sae se ae e! (dog, crab, my, yes, bird, three — all "e")

28
00:01:00,710 --> 00:01:02,930
모양만 달라, 둘 다 에!
moyangman dalla, dul da e! (only the shape is different — both say "e"!)

29
00:01:02,930 --> 00:01:06,150
애, 에, 둘 다 에! 안녕!
ae, e, dul da e! annyeong! (both say "e" — bye!)

30
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,300
이건 뭐?
igeon mwo? (can you read these?)

31
00:01:07,350 --> 00:01:08,350
배
Try reading it first!

32
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:09,300
배!
bae! (boat)

33
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:10,350
카페
Try reading it first!

34
00:01:10,350 --> 00:01:11,300
카페!
kape! (café)

35
00:01:11,350 --> 00:01:12,350
메뉴
Try reading it first!

36
